 Runbook defaults are offline. For optional AI notes, omit `--no-ai` and set
 `SOVEREIGN_AI_API_KEY`, `SOVEREIGN_AI_MODEL` and optionally `SOVEREIGN_AI_BASE_URL`.
 
+### Pricing without a Leaseweb API token
+
+The translator loads a checked-in snapshot in `data/leaseweb_public_prices.json` when
+`data/leaseweb_catalog.json` (an authenticated API catalog) is absent. The source
+URLs and snapshot date are stored in that file. The snapshot includes older
+Public Cloud GPU list prices and same-name CPU prices from **New Public Cloud
+(OpenStack)**; the latter are **proxies**, not verified rates for the older
+Public Cloud API targeted by this tool. OpenStack monthly prices assume a
+1-month savings plan. Proxy and extrapolated prices appear with `*` in
+`report.md`; actual account pricing still requires `LEASEWEB_TOKEN`. The
+compute subtotal does not include storage, load balancers or traffic.
 
